      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "bf54a4ad-6c1f-4197-a80e-9860a57360ec",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "8c0b92d3-a3ea-458b-af7b-77251c449304",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "11f4cde0-1a89-44fd-aca0-56fef5aa5d3b",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "After routing the\nintact crate\nthrough the\nsuitable gate, how\nmany",
                      "weight units of\ncapacity remain on\nthat crossing? The\nlimits are",
                      "maximum loads, not\ntargets that must\nbe filled. Moxie\nwants to know",
                      "whether a one-unit\nhand tool bag can\naccompany the\ncrate without",
                      "breaking the\nlimit. Count the\ncrate first, then\nfind the remaining",
                      "margin."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "7d5d85fd-0a54-41bc-a63c-9b003053b87f",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
